# sdrpp-aia
===
 SDR++ Air Interface Analyzer. TETRA receiver and measurement tool for amateur radio, based on SDR++, SDR++Brown: decoding of cell and traffic information, MER/EVM, TX spectrum, burst and multipath analysis, drive-test logging. Encryption is only indicated, never decrypted. Private project, no support..
